# Cursor & Windsurf AI Assistant Rules

You are assisting development on `smart-mailto`.

## Tech Stack & Tooling
- Package manager: `pnpm` (Workspace monorepo)
- Core package: `packages/smart-mailto` (TypeScript, built with `tsup`)
- Web app: `apps/web` (React 19, Vite, Tailwind CSS v3, Lucide React)
- Testing: `vitest`

## Architectural Rules
1. Zero runtime dependencies in `packages/smart-mailto`.
2. SSR Safety: Never execute browser-only APIs (`window`, `navigator`, `document`) without guarding `typeof window !== 'undefined'`.
3. Design language: Dark obsidian aesthetic (Linear/Raycast inspired), electric emerald accent (`#10b981`), `lucide-react` for all UI icons.
4. Always run `pnpm test; pnpm -r typecheck` after modifying code in `packages/` or `apps/`.
5. NEVER execute `git push` without explicit user confirmation.
